---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Rent Free News" description="Rent Free News privacy policy: data protection principles, analytics disclosure, cookie consent, and user privacy rights.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <div class="kicker text-brand-600">Trust & Legal</div>
    <h1 class="font-display font-black text-[34px] sm:text-[42px] tracking-[-0.02em] mt-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert font-serif mt-6 space-y-6">
      <p class="font-sans text-[17px] text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
        At Rent Free News (<em>rentfreenews.com</em>), we believe privacy is essential to independent journalism. We run a privacy-first static publication with zero user account registration, zero paywall tracking, and zero surveillance advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <p>
        Because we publish statically generated pages, we do not require user accounts, passwords, or personal profile profiles. Browsing our news investigations, category hubs, and methodology reports requires no personal registration or credential submission.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Email Newsletter Subscriptions</h2>
      <p>
        When you voluntarily subscribe to our Sunday footnote or breaking news bulletins, your email address is processed securely by our email delivery partner. Your email address is utilized solely to deliver requested editorial newsletters. Every email includes an immediate, one-click unsubscribe mechanism. We never sell, rent, or trade subscriber contact lists with third parties or data brokers.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Site Analytics & Measurement</h2>
      <p>
        To understand readership trends and identify which stories resonate with our audience, we utilize Google Analytics 4 under privacy-conscious configurations:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 font-sans text-[15px]">
        <li><strong>IP Anonymization:</strong> IP addresses are truncated at the earliest point of ingestion to prevent identification of individual users.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookie Consent:</strong> First-time visitors receive a transparent cookie banner. Declining consent transmits only anonymous, cookieless telemetry signals that are not tied to individual profiles.</li>
        <li><strong>Opt-Out Options:</strong> You may modify your consent choice at any time using the "Cookie settings" control in our footer, or install the official Google Analytics Opt-Out Browser Add-on.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. External Links & Embedded Content</h2>
      <p>
        Our articles frequently reference primary sources, research papers, video timestamps, and official public records hosted on third-party domains. When you click an external link, you leave our site and become subject to the respective external site's privacy terms and data practices.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Data Rights & Inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        Under applicable data protection frameworks (including GDPR and CCPA), you possess the right to request confirmation regarding whether we process your personal data and to request deletion of your newsletter subscription records.
      </p>
      <p>
        For any privacy concerns, contact our editorial and data desk:
      </p>
      <div class="rounded-[10px] border border-hairline dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 p-5 font-sans text-[14px] not-prose space-y-2">
        <div><strong>Editorial & Privacy Inquiries:</strong> <a href="mailto:editor@rentfreenews.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">editor@rentfreenews.com</a></div>
        <div><strong>Newsroom Desk:</strong> <a href="mailto:desk@rentfreenews.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">desk@rentfreenews.com</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

